<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Thermedics cut by Barrington.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Thermedics cut by Barrington.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Barrington Research analyst Michael Hutchison said he reduced his rating on Thermedics Inc to 2-Buy from 1-Buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were off 3/16 to 18-1/16.</p>
<p>-- Hutchison said he made the move based on weak first quarter results.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
